			"@%s just unlocked the Neo Performante. Sheesh... bro's rich. 🔥",
			"@%s just drove away with the Neo Performante. That's some serious cash. 💸",
			"@%s just added the Neo Performante to their garage. Bro is built different. 😭",
			"@%s just bought the Neo Performante. Someone's wallet is taking a hit. 💀",
